# VOX sings by itself when asked: a VOX sound's key held and ALGO turned right, that sound sings (rarely,
# now and then, often): a few soft notes in the key, not the hands', with rests between. It sings with
# that sound whichever is in hand after; a second sound set beside it sings too, each its own phrases;
# left again, each stops. Nothing sings as made, or with the clock
# stopped. The tempo is not turned by that ALGO.
wait 1000
expect vsing 0
wait 20000
expect vox_notes 0
key b8 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 3
wait 100
key b8 up
expect vsing2 3
expect set_bpm 90
shot sing.png
key b9 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 2
wait 100
key b9 up
expect vsing2 3
expect vsing3 2
tapkey b7
wait 100
expect vcur 1
expect sung <99
wait 60000
expect vox_notes >3
expect sung 6
expect clips 0
tap SEQ
wait 5000
expect vox_sounds 0
expect vox_notes <99
wait 20000
expect vox_notes 0
tap SEQ
wait 30000
expect vox_notes >0
key b8 down
wait 100
turn ALGO -3
wait 100
key b8 up
key b9 down
wait 100
turn ALGO -3
wait 100
key b9 up
expect vsing 0
wait 4000
expect vox_notes <99
wait 30000
expect vox_notes 0
expect clips 0
